# Going from Upcoming to Today focuses the same block when Today lists it too.
file <<END
- Spans @start({today}) @due({today+2})
- Late start @start({today-1}) @due({today+3})
- Over @due({today-1})
END
keys gU j
see ▌ - Late start
keys gt
see 󰖙 Today
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- Spans @start({today}) @due({today+2})
- Late start @start({today-1}) @due({today+3}) @done({today})
- Over @due({today-1})
END
